1","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[1]}],"link":"48529","synopsis":"Whilst being forced to clean the school pool Tomo and the rest of the Science Club stumble across an underground cavern which leads them to the Rakuroa Ruins. Here Tomo sees a strange vision of an alternate world. However, before he can learn more the group is attacked by Castas Machina guarding the ruins and Touru has to show up to save them.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9orb4aZNVx95UhzjSSDz62RBzkd.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 1","synopsis":"Whilst being forced to clean the school pool Tomo and the rest of the Science Club stumble across an underground cavern which leads them to the Rakuroa Ruins. Here Tomo sees a strange vision of an alternate world. However, before he can learn more the group is attacked by Castas Machina guarding the ruins and Touru has to show up to save them.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9orb4aZNVx95UhzjSSDz62RBzkd.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 2","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6769","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6676","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6676","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42425","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"87981","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[2]}],"link":"48530","synopsis":"Tomo is growing increasingly concerned about Misao and asks Shuri and Touru to locate his brother, Naotaka. In exchange Tomo must persuade the reclusive Science Club president Tokiya Kagayaki to return to school. However, this is not as easy as it first sounds so Tomo takes Misao and Takatsuki along to help. Tomo also learns that Touru and Tokiya have a very tragic connection to Kurogane.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/m5iqrBCWUNYm9xnSg80Dl0eRxC6.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 2","synopsis":"Tomo is growing increasingly concerned about Misao and asks Shuri and Touru to locate his brother, Naotaka. In exchange Tomo must persuade the reclusive Science Club president Tokiya Kagayaki to return to school. However, this is not as easy as it first sounds so Tomo takes Misao and Takatsuki along to help. Tomo also learns that Touru and Tokiya have a very tragic connection to Kurogane.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/m5iqrBCWUNYm9xnSg80Dl0eRxC6.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 3","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6769","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6676","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6676","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42425","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"87981","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[3]}],"link":"48531","synopsis":"Tomo, Takatsuki, Misao, An and Higuchi are all enjoying a working vacation at the beach but it isn't long before Tomo manages to upset Misao. Meanwhile, Shuri and Ania are investigating the ruins on a nearby island. However, it seems that Kagakagari and Kristina are also interested in them, as is Kyomu Satomi and the First Student Council.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tIuT3SyERNg2KkdQk8qsnjBo8fP.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 3","synopsis":"Tomo, Takatsuki, Misao, An and Higuchi are all enjoying a working vacation at the beach but it isn't long before Tomo manages to upset Misao. Meanwhile, Shuri and Ania are investigating the ruins on a nearby island. However, it seems that Kagakagari and Kristina are also interested in them, as is Kyomu Satomi and the First Student Council.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tIuT3SyERNg2KkdQk8qsnjBo8fP.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 4","episodeNumber":4,"sourceEpisodeNumber":4,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6769","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6676","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6676","episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42425","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[4]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"87981","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[4]}],"link":"48532","synopsis":"Tomo and the others are apparently saved by Tomo's brother, Naotaka and then taken in by Kagakagari and Kristina. Kagakagari reveals that the ruins are the remnants of an Asura Machina testing ground and that they may contain a way to free Burial Dolls like Kotori and Misao. However, before they can retrieve the device Kyomu arrives and tries to use Ania as a hostage.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tPqHOtx17ooVvhBZUSzg1iSOS7w.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 4","synopsis":"Tomo and the others are apparently saved by Tomo's brother, Naotaka and then taken in by Kagakagari and Kristina. Kagakagari reveals that the ruins are the remnants of an Asura Machina testing ground and that they may contain a way to free Burial Dolls like Kotori and Misao. However, before they can retrieve the device Kyomu arrives and tries to use Ania as a hostage.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tPqHOtx17ooVvhBZUSzg1iSOS7w.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 5","episodeNumber":5,"sourceEpisodeNumber":5,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6769","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6676","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6676","episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42425","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"87981","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[5]}],"link":"48533","synopsis":"Following a mishap with some industrial strength glue whilst practicing for the three-legged race, Tomo and Takatsuki end up stuck together for the rest of the day. As if protecting each other's modesty and organising sleeping arrangements weren't trouble enough, Takatsuki's family is currently under threat from a rival group of demons who are out to assassinate them.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iMd24amMamKCIvn1Nv6MipHBfiI.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 5","synopsis":"Following a mishap with some industrial strength glue whilst practicing for the three-legged race, Tomo and Takatsuki end up stuck together for the rest of the day. As if protecting each other's modesty and organising sleeping arrangements weren't trouble enough, Takatsuki's family is currently under threat from a rival group of demons who are out to assassinate them.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/iMd24amMamKCIvn1Nv6MipHBfiI.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 6","episodeNumber":6,"sourceEpisodeNumber":6,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6769","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6676","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6676","episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42425","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"87981","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[6]}],"link":"48534","synopsis":"After receiving a cryptic warning from his brother, Tomo and the others come under attack from a mysterious woman and are forced into a trap set by Hiwako Torishima. The group are then saved by a powerful Asura Machina and Tomo makes a serious of shocking discovery's about his brother, Misao and the Asura Machina themselves.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vJ1S7EGATAWLH4geeCQFmCeKbgc.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 6","synopsis":"After receiving a cryptic warning from his brother, Tomo and the others come under attack from a mysterious woman and are forced into a trap set by Hiwako Torishima. The group are then saved by a powerful Asura Machina and Tomo makes a serious of shocking discovery's about his brother, Misao and the Asura Machina themselves.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vJ1S7EGATAWLH4geeCQFmCeKbgc.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 7","episodeNumber":7,"sourceEpisodeNumber":7,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6769","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6676","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6676","episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42425","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[7]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"87981","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[7]}],"link":"48535","synopsis":"Despite having been arrested by Haruna, along with Tomo and the others, Ania is kidnapped by Hiwako's masked henchwoman. Hiwako then offers to trade Ania for Tomo and the group decides it is the perfect opportunity to ambush her, with Susugihara's help. However, things go badly wrong when it is revealed that Hiwako, Touru and Tokiya have been working together behind the scenes and even the appearance of Naotaka is not enough to halt their plans.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vA42yYbYlhYMIpVwvOdWykW1O86.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 7","synopsis":"Despite having been arrested by Haruna, along with Tomo and the others, Ania is kidnapped by Hiwako's masked henchwoman. Hiwako then offers to trade Ania for Tomo and the group decides it is the perfect opportunity to ambush her, with Susugihara's help. However, things go badly wrong when it is revealed that Hiwako, Touru and Tokiya have been working together behind the scenes and even the appearance of Naotaka is not enough to halt their plans.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vA42yYbYlhYMIpVwvOdWykW1O86.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 8","episodeNumber":8,"sourceEpisodeNumber":8,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6769","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6676","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6676","episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42425","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[8]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"87981","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[8]}],"link":"48536","synopsis":"Following Hagane's attack Tomo awakes to find himself all alone in the First World with no idea of how to get back. He soon encounters the 'Witch of Rakurowa High School', a strange Daughter and very strange versions of the people he knows. However, after a chance encounter with Tokiya's sister Aki he is reunited with Takatsuki. He also learns more about the Superstring Gravity Reactor accident that started everything.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5BuL9pdCtWdmStwhziKKic6NI2n.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 8","synopsis":"Following Hagane's attack Tomo awakes to find himself all alone in the First World with no idea of how to get back. He soon encounters the 'Witch of Rakurowa High School', a strange Daughter and very strange versions of the people he knows. However, after a chance encounter with Tokiya's sister Aki he is reunited with Takatsuki. He also learns more about the Superstring Gravity Reactor accident that started everything.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5BuL9pdCtWdmStwhziKKic6NI2n.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 9","episodeNumber":9,"sourceEpisodeNumber":9,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6769","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6676","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6676","episodeNumbers":[9]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42425","scope":"s2","seas