there is nothing Tomo can do.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g0SpKeQvkkgfLRXT1puaxfUG1Qj.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 10","synopsis":"Tomo finally gets to meet with the real Naotaka and learns that there is a way to save the First World even without Hagane. However, the plan is extremely dangerous and there is no guarantee that both Tomo and Misao won't be killed in the process. In the end the plan is a success but unfortunately Takatsuki ends up getting hurt and there is nothing Tomo can do.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g0SpKeQvkkgfLRXT1puaxfUG1Qj.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 11","episodeNumber":11,"sourceEpisodeNumber":11,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6769","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6676","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6676","episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42425","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[11]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"87981","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[11]}],"link":"48539","synopsis":"Now back in the Second World Tomo and the others discover that they have 10 days until Tokiya can set his plan in motion. Tomo also discovers that he has inadvertently entered a contract with Takatsuki and that they now have a Daughter, Persephone. As if that wasn't enough Tomo is then appointed as the new President of the Third Student Council. Unfortunately, there is no time to deal with all of these new events as Tokiya has a found a way to accelerate his plan and Tomo must once again try to save the world.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g6ud2GI6MNzfJmscQIlPxzhpdgg.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 11","synopsis":"Now back in the Second World Tomo and the others discover that they have 10 days until Tokiya can set his plan in motion. Tomo also discovers that he has inadvertently entered a contract with Takatsuki and that they now have a Daughter, Persephone. As if that wasn't enough Tomo is then appointed as the new President of the Third Student Council. Unfortunately, there is no time to deal with all of these new events as Tokiya has a found a way to accelerate his plan and Tomo must once again try to save the world.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/g6ud2GI6MNzfJmscQIlPxzhpdgg.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 12","episodeNumber":12,"sourceEpisodeNumber":12,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6769","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6676","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6676","episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42425","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[12]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"87981","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[12]}],"link":"48540","synopsis":"Tokiya has managed to open the gate to the Third World and the Second World has begun to vanish at an alarming rate. As such Tomo and the others must gain access to the Central Vortex in order to confront Tokiya and save the world. However, with Tokiya in control of not only Hagane but Hisui, Bismuth and Rhodonite as well that may not be as easy as it sounds.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4JaYpOVfuc3gQ0aZJbN61k9jbwg.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 12","synopsis":"Tokiya has managed to open the gate to the Third World and the Second World has begun to vanish at an alarming rate. As such Tomo and the others must gain access to the Central Vortex in order to confront Tokiya and save the world. However, with Tokiya in control of not only Hagane but Hisui, Bismuth and Rhodonite as well that may not be as easy as it sounds.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4JaYpOVfuc3gQ0aZJbN61k9jbwg.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 13","episodeNumber":13,"sourceEpisodeNumber":13,"seasonNumber":2,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anidb","id":"6769","scope":"R","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"anilist","id":"6676","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"mal","id":"6676","episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"42425","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[13]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"87981","scope":"s2","seasonNumber":2,"episodeNumbers":[13]}],"link":"48541","synopsis":"Natsume Tomoharu and his friends goes to save the world. Tokiya Kagayaki wants to keep the Igniter so he could have a third world that has Aki, his lover. After Tomoharu defeated Tokiya, the Igniter seems to respond to Tomoharu's wish and closed the gate to the third world. After that, Ania Fortuna told Tomoharu that she completed the Splitter. So then she asked if Himazasa and Misao Minakami wanted to become human again and they did. After that everything became normal and all demons became humans. Everything from the First world disappeared including the Asura Machinas. Ania and Vivian returned to their normal sizes.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vu5kmi0o47UagxOy0fVQiEogEnf.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 13","synopsis":"Natsume Tomoharu and his friends goes to save the world. Tokiya Kagayaki wants to keep the Igniter so he could have a third world that has Aki, his lover. After Tomoharu defeated Tokiya, the Igniter seems to respond to Tomoharu's wish and closed the gate to the third world. After that, Ania Fortuna told Tomoharu that she completed the Splitter. So then she asked if Himazasa and Misao Minakami wanted to become human again and they did. After that everything became normal and all demons became humans. Everything from the First world disappeared including the Asura Machinas. Ania and Vivian returned to their normal sizes.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vu5kmi0o47UagxOy0fVQiEogEnf.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}}],"mappings":{"source":"anibridge-v3",